TITLE Mix 50 mM DIC with 50 mM Ca (1:1), equilibrate with calcite at 100 C

SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50

SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
SAVE solution 3
END

USE solution 3
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -temperature true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Temp_C Ionic_strength
    10 PUNCH TC, MU
END
